## BENEFITS OF DEVOPS IN MACHINE LEARNING

1. Faster deployment of machine learning models.
2. Automatic testing and updating.
3. Reduced manual work.
4. Improved model quality.
5. Easy tracking of code and model versions.
6. Better collaboration between developers and data scientists.
7. Early detection of errors.
8. Easier maintenance of deployed models.

